INFO:__main__:Prompt Metadata:
INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:{    "action": "Given the current environment and my status, I recognize the need to prioritize shelter and food preparation due to the light drizzle and moderate wildlife danger. I will:    1. Reinforce my lean-to shelter to protect against increasing rain        - Use nearby branches and large leaves for additional waterproofing        - Ensure ground area is slightly elevated to prevent water pooling        - Create a small windbreak using fallen logs    2. Food gathering strategy        - Collect visible wild berries, being cautious of potential toxic varieties        - Set simple snare traps near small mammal movement paths        - Use rocks and sticks to create basic hunting implements    3. Water procurement        - Collect river water, using large leaves as makeshift container        - Boil water if possible to eliminate potential waterborne pathogens        - Store extra water in improvised containers for later use    Reasoning reflects survival instincts, leveraging current environmental conditions and maintaining personal safety. The overcast sky and light drizzle suggest preparing for potential weather changes while maintaining energy conservation.    Potential risks include wildlife encounters and exposure to changing environmental conditions. My current health status allows for moderate physical activity, so I will move deliberately and conserve energy."}
